                "text": "You may cast Deliver Unto Evil with fewer than four targets. However, if you don't control a Bolas planeswalker as Deliver Unto Evil resolves, your opponent will choose two of however many cards you did target (or one or zero, if you chose fewer than two) and the remainder (if any) will be put into your hand."
