                "text": "Follow the instructions in the order listed on Jace's first loyalty ability: if you target yourself, you'll put the top two cards of your library into your graveyard and then draw a card."
            },
            {
                "date": "2019-05-03",
                "text": "If your library has fewer than seven cards in it while resolving Jace's last ability, and Jace has already left the battlefield, you'll draw as many cards as you can and then win the game before state-based actions would cause you to lose the game for trying to draw from an empty library."
            }
        ]
